OL,3,AMillennials have found it hard to buy
OL,4,Ahomes ` but things may be turning a
OL,5,Acorner
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeaving education, getting a job,
OL,8,Fbuying a home and perhaps starting a
OL,9,Ffamily: the path previous generations
OL,10,Ffollowed may seem a distant dream to
OL,11,Fmany now.
OL,13,FBut is it getting a bit easier - at
OL,14,Fleast when it comes to getting on the
OL,15,Fhousing ladder?
OL,17,FToday's prospective first-time buyers
OL,18,Fmay well feel hard done by; they are
OL,19,Fstill worse off than recent
OL,20,Fgenerations.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
